# Platform — Hotsite template catalogue (TD56-S04)
# Manager lists the platform-owned templates and applies one to the draft they are editing.
# Guarded by ManagerRoleGuard — requires X-Actor-Role: MANAGER on every request.
# Applying is pure: nothing is saved or published; the returned draft is the manager's to edit and
# publish through the normal flow.
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up   (also uploads the template images to the local GCS emulator)
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run seed
#   4. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar

@baseUrl = {{backendUrl}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HAPPY PATH
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List the catalogue: id, version, thumbnailUrl and capabilities (no display strings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/hotsite/templates
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: MANAGER

###

### Apply Casa47 to an empty draft (copy follows the tenant's own language)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/hotsite/templates/casa47/apply
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: MANAGER
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {
    "branding": { "brandName": "Lava Car", "brandTagline": "Estética automotiva" },
    "layout": [],
    "seo": {}
  }
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ERROR CASES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Unknown template id → 404 PLATFORM_HOTSITE_TEMPLATE_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/hotsite/templates/unknown/apply
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: MANAGER
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": { "branding": {}, "layout": [], "seo": {} } }

###

### Missing layout → 400 (request validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants/hotsite/templates/casa47/apply
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: MANAGER
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": { "branding": {}, "seo": {} } }

###

### Staff (not manager) → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/hotsite/templates
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: STAFF
